    {
      "text": "证明函数 $H(t)=\\int_0^\\infty\\dfrac{e^{-x}\\sin(tx)}{1+x^2}dx$ 在 $\\mathbb{R}$ 上可微，并写出 $H'(t)$ 的积分表达式。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "Leibniz求导法则",
        "控制收敛"
      ],
      "question_type": "可微性证明",
      "method": [
        "求偏导后估计控制函数证明可微"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "对t求偏导",
        "估计控制函数并应用Leibniz定理"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "parametric_integral_differentiability",
        "template": "H(t)=\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{e^{-x}\\sin(tx)}{1+x^2}dx",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "证明",
          "steps": [
            "偏导 $\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial t}\\left(\\frac{e^{-x}\\sin(tx)}{1+x^2}\\right)=\\frac{xe^{-x}\\cos(tx)}{1+x^2}$，绝对值不超过 $\\frac{xe^{-x}}{1+x^2}=:g(x)$，与t无关且在$[0,\\infty)$上可积（指数衰减主导）",
            "由Leibniz法则，$H$可导且 $H'(t)=\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{xe^{-x}\\cos(tx)}{1+x^2}dx$",
            "该积分关于t连续，故H是$C^1$函数"
          ]
        }
      ],
