      "question_type": "综合练习（结构类比原题）",
      "method": [
        "代入t=0求值",
        "控制收敛证明可微"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "代入t=0化简为标准积分求值",
        "对t求偏导并估计控制函数证明可微"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "parametric_integral_differentiability",
        "template": "F_2(t)=\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{3+\\cos(tx^3)}{1+x^6}dx",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "求F_2(0)及可微性",
          "steps": [
            "$F_2(0)=\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{3+1}{1+x^6}dx=4\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{dx}{1+x^6}$，利用公式 $\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{dx}{1+x^6}=\\frac{\\pi/6}{\\sin(\\pi/6)}=\\frac{\\pi/6}{1/2}=\\frac{\\pi}{3}$，故 $F_2(0)=4\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{3}=\\frac{4\\pi}{3}$",
            "偏导 $\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial t}\\left(\\frac{3+\\cos(tx^3)}{1+x^6}\\right)=\\frac{-x^3\\sin(tx^3)}{1+x^6}$，绝对值 $\\le\\frac{x^3}{1+x^6}$，该函数在$[0,\\infty)$上可积（$\\sim1/x^3$ 当 $x\\to\\infty$）",
            "由Leibniz法则，$F_2$在$\\mathbb{R}$上处处可导，结论成立"
          ]
        }
      ],
